DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The vvmm__ppaaggee__ddoonnttnneeeedd() function advises the VM system that the given page
     is no longer required.  If the page is already in the inactive queue or
     in the cache queue, this function does nothing; otherwise the page is de‐
     activated.

     Note that vvmm__ppaaggee__ddoonnttnneeeedd() does not necessarily deactivate a page, but
     instead implements an algorithm that attempts to prevent small objects
     from having their pages reused too quickly, and large objects from flush‐
     ing smaller ones from the queues as their pages are released.

